7	/**
8	 * Records the new owner's {@code householdSize}: the number of owners that share this owner's
9	 * {@code householdId} once this owner is created, counting the new owner itself. When the owner has
10	 * no household (no {@code householdId}, i.e. the request did not opt in with {@code sharesHousehold}),
11	 * the size is 1.
